          "name": "PoCRA agriculture facility locator",
          "shortDesc": "On-demand search for custom hiring centres, Krishi Vigyan Kendras, warehouses and soil testing laboratories across Maharashtra.",
          "longDesc": "One Resource, not one per facility. PoCRA aggregates facility registries from several Maharashtra departments and answers a search around a point, ranking results by distance, so there is no enumerable list of facilities to publish. Consumers discover this Resource by falling inside its coverage area and then invoke the Provider with a search origin and the facility types they want, receiving one Direct AgricultureFacility Resource per facility found."
        },
        "isActive": true,
        "provider": {
